#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/adapters.py
msgid "INSEE (Sirene) and INPI (RNE), through the DINUM's API Recherche d'entreprises"
msgstr "INSEE (Sirene) ও INPI (RNE), DINUM-এর API Recherche d'entreprises-এর মাধ্যমে"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
msgid "Look a company up in its country's register when you press for it, from its register number (France, Norway, Finland, Czechia, Poland, and the United Kingdom once a key is saved) or its LEI (GLEIF), and choose which of the official name, address, state and activity to keep. One request per press, carrying the number and nothing else, to the register's own service, which so learns which company somebody here is looking at. Off until an administrator switches it on; switched off, nothing is asked and nothing already kept is touched."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/adapters.py
msgid "National Court Register (KRS), Ministry of Justice of Poland"
msgstr "জাতীয় আদালত নিবন্ধন (KRS), পোল্যান্ডের বিচার মন্ত্রণালয়"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
msgid "Register lookup"
msgstr "নিবন্ধন খোঁজ"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
msgid "Which registers Register lookup can ask, one per country, and how each one's answer is read: the Annuaire des Entreprises (France), Enhetsregisteret (Norway), YTJ (Finland), ARES (Czechia), KRS (Poland), Companies House (United Kingdom, with a key) and GLEIF. Nothing here asks anything by itself."
msgstr ""
